event: node_complete
data: {"id": "4d169a4425f54744-node_complete-layer", "run_id": "4d169a4425f54744", "seq": 17, "ts_ms": 1789113790925, "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "duration_seconds": 27.818, "state_snapshot": {"layer": "Layer.ABNORMAL", "layers": ["ABNORMAL"], "layer_confidence": 0.5, "layer_reasoning": "根据工具返回数据，集群中存在两类主要的 Pending 状态异常：\n1. **业务 Pod 调度失败**：在 `aiops-case-v03` 命名空间下，Pod `workload` 处于 Pending 状态，持续时间较短（22-23s），无 IP 分配，属于典型的调度异常。\n2. **存储/PVC 绑定失败**：在 `monitor` 命名空间下，存在 8 个 Byconity 相关的 PVC（如 `local-disk-observability-byconity-server-0` 等）长期处于 Pending 状态（140天）。根据 Runbook 规则，PVC 未绑定通常指向存储问题而非纯粹的节点资源调度问题，归类为 `storage-provisioning-failed` 或 `pvc-pending`。\n\n节点层面无 `NotReady` 或 `SchedulingDisabled` 异常，3 个节点（master, node1, node2）均为 Ready 状态。因此，当前活跃异常主要集中在 Pod 和 PVC 的调度/绑定阶段。", "layer_analysis": "{\"layer\": \"SCHEDULING\", \"derived_layer\": \"\", \"layers\": [], \"layer_name\": \"\", \"confidence\": 0.5, \"reasoning\": \"根据工具返回数据，集群中存在两类主要的 Pending 状态异常：\\n1. **业务 Pod 调度失败**：在 `aiops-case-v03` 命名空间下，Pod `workload` 处于 Pending 状态，持续时间较短（22-23s），无 IP 分配，属于典型的调度异常。\\n2. **存储/PVC 绑定失败**：在 `monitor` 命名空间下，存在 8 个 Byconity 相关的 PVC（如 `local-disk-observability-byconity-server-0` 等）长期处于 Pending 状态（140天）。根据 Runbook 规则，PVC 未绑定通常指向存储问题而非纯粹的节点资源调度问题，归类为 `storage-provisioning-failed` 或 `pvc-pending`。\\n\\n节点层面无 `NotReady` 或 `SchedulingDisabled` 异常，3 个节点（master, node1, node2）均为 Ready 状态。因此，当前活跃异常主要集中在 Pod 和 PVC 的调度/绑定阶段。\", \"abnormal_pods\": [{\"name\": \"workload\", \"namespace\": \"aiops-case-v03\", \"status\": \"Pending\"}], \"pod_status_keyword\": \"Pending\", \"pod_abnormal_type\": \"PendingUnschedulable\", \"status_category\": \"ABNORMAL\", \"key_entities\": [{\"type\": \"pod\", \"name\": \"workload\", \"namespace\": \"aiops-case-v03\"}, {\"type\": \"pvc\", \"name\": \"local-disk-observability-byconity-server-0\", \"namespace\": \"monitor\"}, {\"type\": \"pvc\", \"name\": \"local-disk-observability-byconity-tso-0\", \"namespace\": \"monitor\"}, {\"type\": \"pvc\", \"name\": \"local-disk-observability-byconity-vw-vw-default-0\", \"namespace\": \"monitor\"}, {\"type\": \"pvc\", \"name\": \"local-disk-observability-byconity-vw-vw-write-0\", \"namespace\": \"monitor\"}, {\"type\": \"pvc\", \"name\": \"log-observability-byconity-server-0\", \"namespace\": \"monitor\"}, {\"type\": \"pvc\", \"name\": \"log-observability-byconity-tso-0\", \"namespace\": \"monitor\"}, {\"type\": \"pvc\", \"name\": \"log-observability-byconity-vw-vw-default-0\", \"namespace\": \"monitor\"}, {\"type\": \"pvc\", \"name\": \"log-observability-byconity-vw-vw-write-0\", \"namespace\": \"monitor\"}], \"possible_scenarios\": [{\"scenario\": \"Pod 调度失败 (PendingUnschedulable)\", \"probability\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"Pod workload 在 aiops-case-v03 命名空间中处于 Pending 状态且无 IP，结合 Runbook，需进一步确认是否因资源不足、亲和性不匹配或 taint 导致。\"}, {\"scenario\": \"PVC 未绑定导致 Pod Pending\", \"probability\": \"high\", \"reason\": \"monitor 命名空间下有 8 个 PVC 处于 Pending 状态长达 140 天，极可能涉及存储后端（如 local-disk）可用性问题或 StorageClass 配置错误，导致依赖这些 PVC 的 Pod 无法正常调度或启动。\"}], \"abnormal_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"g1\", \"status_keywords\": [\"Pending\"], \"pod_abnormal_type\": \"PendingUnschedulable\", \"compatible_layers\": [], \"entities\": [{\"kind\": \"Pod\", \"namespace\": \"aiops-case-v03\", \"name\": \"workload\"}], \"evidence_plan\": [], \"possible_scenarios\": [{\"scenario\": \"PendingUnschedulable 的直接原因待验证\", \"probability\": \"未知\", \"reason\": \"当前阶段只定位异常；根因必须由后续实时 canonical facts 确认\"}], \"matched_runbooks\": [\"pod-pending-unschedulable.md\"]}], \"issue_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"g1\", \"status_keywords\": [\"Pending\"], \"pod_abnormal_type\": \"PendingUnschedulable\", \"compatible_layers\": [], \"entities\": [{\"kind\": \"Pod\", \"namespace\": \"aiops-case-v03\", \"name\": \"workload\"}], \"evidence_plan\": [], \"possible_scenarios\": [{\"scenario\": \"PendingUnschedulable 的直接原因待验证\", \"probability\": \"未知\", \"reason\": \"当前阶段只定位异常；根因必须由后续实时 canonical facts 确认\"}], \"matched_runbooks\": [\"pod-pending-un